-- Experiment 204 -- SIAM 100-Digit Challenge, holdout A for Problem 9 (FriCAS column).
-- FriCAS has no numeric optimiser and no root finder for a non-polynomial
-- function (as in experiment 174): all rows SKIP.  See parametric_extremum.m.
